WEBVTT

00:00:05.665 --> 00:00:06.665
Longclaw?

00:00:06.926 --> 00:00:07.926
Hello, Sonic.

00:00:08.606 --> 00:00:11.486
If you're watching this,
then something has
happened to me.

00:00:12.085 --> 00:00:14.605
And I pray you've made it
to Earth unharmed.

00:00:15.486 --> 00:00:18.906
This world has been chosen
for a very important reason.

00:00:19.706 --> 00:00:23.166
It's the secret location
of the Master Emerald.

00:00:24.266 --> 00:00:25.266
Whoa.

00:00:25.545 --> 00:00:28.985
The Emerald has the power
to turn thoughts
into reality.

00:00:29.082 --> 00:00:31.629
Like the
Stay Puft Marshmallow Man
from Ghostbusters.

00:00:31.629 --> 00:00:32.629
Shh!

00:00:32.726 --> 00:00:33.946
In the wrong hands,

00:00:34.226 --> 00:00:36.606
it could threaten
all life in the universe.

00:00:37.206 --> 00:00:39.546
Protecting the Emerald
was my sacred duty.

00:00:40.066 --> 00:00:43.566
And now I must pass
that responsibility to you.

00:00:45.066 --> 00:00:46.926
This is my moment.

00:00:47.706 --> 00:00:50.926
Follow the map,
find the Emerald,
and keep it safe.

00:00:51.666 --> 00:00:52.666
My dear Sonic,

00:00:53.106 --> 00:00:56.006
you have a heart
like no creature
I've ever known.

00:00:56.786 --> 00:00:58.266
I love you so much.

00:01:00.046 --> 00:01:01.046
Goodbye.

00:01:03.126 --> 00:01:04.244
No, no, wait.
[sighs]

00:01:11.276 --> 00:01:13.515
I won't let you down,
Longclaw.

00:01:15.296 --> 00:01:18.296
So is that
y-your dad?

00:01:18.736 --> 00:01:19.736
What?

00:01:19.938 --> 00:01:21.755
No?

00:01:21.956 --> 00:01:23.256
According to this map,

00:01:23.356 --> 00:01:25.036
the first clue
is in Siberia.

00:01:25.196 --> 00:01:27.276
It's a compass
that will lead
to the Emerald.

00:01:27.456 --> 00:01:30.155
And with Knuckles
already here,
it's a race.

00:01:30.494 --> 00:01:31.494
Knuckles?

00:01:31.936 --> 00:01:33.856
I knew a kid
in middle school
named Knuckles.

00:01:33.856 --> 00:01:35.336
Could fit his whole fist
in his mouth.

00:01:35.836 --> 00:01:37.615
If this is
the same Knuckles...

00:01:37.712 --> 00:01:39.559
[exhales]
...we are screwed.

00:01:39.655 --> 00:01:42.036
This Knuckles,
that Knuckles.
It doesn't matter.

00:01:42.536 --> 00:01:43.776
We're gonna get there first.

00:01:44.795 --> 00:01:46.041
[chuckles]

00:01:47.266 --> 00:01:48.806
What do you mean, "we"?

00:01:48.806 --> 00:01:50.246
You're coming with me.

00:01:50.346 --> 00:01:51.426
Oh, no, no, no.

00:01:51.946 --> 00:01:55.046
I just came here to warn you.
I'm not a field guy.

00:01:55.226 --> 00:01:56.946
Don't worry.
I got your back.

00:01:57.046 --> 00:01:58.946
I won't let anything
happen to you.

00:02:00.286 --> 00:02:01.446
It's a power bump.

00:02:01.446 --> 00:02:03.906
On Earth, it means
an unbreakable promise.

00:02:04.865 --> 00:02:06.986
Okay, I'm in.

00:02:07.616 --> 00:02:09.579
["Me and You" playing]

00:02:09.685 --> 00:02:14.312
♪ Me and you
Maybe sunshine, maybe rain♪

00:02:22.726 --> 00:02:24.925
Doctor.
It's really you.

00:02:25.726 --> 00:02:27.385
You look different.

00:02:28.305 --> 00:02:30.285
Papa's got
a brand new 'stache.

00:02:31.092 --> 00:02:32.400
Ha!

00:02:33.476 --> 00:02:36.075
I knew it. I knew it!

00:02:36.076 --> 00:02:37.276
I knew you'd come back, sir.

00:02:37.715 --> 00:02:39.816
I never stopped steaming
your Austrian goat's milk.

00:02:43.321 --> 00:02:44.908
[Robotnik smacks lips]

00:02:45.576 --> 00:02:46.815
Could use some mushroom.

00:02:48.825 --> 00:02:50.065
You brought something.

00:02:50.825 --> 00:02:53.845
Some kind of, uh,
space porcupine.

00:02:54.765 --> 00:02:57.106
Porcupine?
I am an Echidna!

00:02:57.565 --> 00:03:00.166
Trained since birth
in all forms
of lethal combat,

00:03:00.425 --> 00:03:02.545
destined to restore honor
to my tribe,

00:03:02.545 --> 00:03:06.106
and willing to destroy
anything that gets in my way.

00:03:06.865 --> 00:03:07.865
Welcome to the team.

00:03:07.967 --> 00:03:10.126
[bones cracking]
[groaning]

00:03:10.228 --> 00:03:13.963
[gasping]
[laughing]

00:03:14.066 --> 00:03:16.026
That means
he trusts you, Stone.

00:03:16.986 --> 00:03:19.526
Now let's renovate
this dump!

00:03:20.466 --> 00:03:22.526
Latte with steamed
Austrian goat milk!

00:03:23.668 --> 00:03:26.631
[machinery whirring]

00:03:40.444 --> 00:03:42.192
[grunts]
[players cheering]

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:44.798
Good one. Solid.

00:03:45.976 --> 00:03:48.831
[grunting]

00:03:48.938 --> 00:03:51.544
[players laughing, cheering]

00:03:51.651 --> 00:03:53.329
Sorry, fellas.
[player] That's game!

00:03:53.436 --> 00:03:55.956
Ha! That's how we do!
That's how we do!

00:03:56.195 --> 00:03:57.195
But are they good at math?

00:03:57.415 --> 00:03:58.755
[player]
Teamwork makes the dream work!

00:03:59.175 --> 00:04:00.315
Sorry about that,
Big Tom.

00:04:00.415 --> 00:04:02.875
Are you good?
All good. Fine.

00:04:03.596 --> 00:04:06.436
Thanks for inviting me
out to hang with you
and your groomsmen.

00:04:06.516 --> 00:04:07.855
Good quality bonding.

00:04:08.415 --> 00:04:09.415
You know, bro,

00:04:09.835 --> 00:04:11.795
those guys right there,
they're way more
than my groomsmen.

00:04:12.235 --> 00:04:13.235
That's my squad.

00:04:13.635 --> 00:04:15.115
Never would've made it
through life without 'em.

00:04:15.495 --> 00:04:16.495
Get over here!

00:04:16.735 --> 00:04:18.775
Yeah, I'm coming!
I'm coming!

00:04:19.295 --> 00:04:20.295
I'll catch you later.

00:04:20.595 --> 00:04:21.675
Hey. Yeah!

00:04:22.275 --> 00:04:24.135
Let me know if you're ready
for some power yoga, huh?

00:04:24.235 --> 00:04:26.515
You bet.
Come on, Tommy boy.
Let's go.

00:04:26.715 --> 00:04:28.035
Don't make me.
[laughs]

00:04:29.195 --> 00:04:30.375
What am I doing?

00:04:30.695 --> 00:04:31.695
Hey, Uncle Tommy!

00:04:32.115 --> 00:04:33.515
Hey, girls!

00:04:33.855 --> 00:04:34.855
How you do-- Oh!

00:04:35.255 --> 00:04:36.795
Are those
the wedding rings?
Uh-huh.

00:04:36.916 --> 00:04:37.875
May I?

00:04:37.875 --> 00:04:41.415
This little ring bearer
has been taking her job
very seriously.

00:04:41.815 --> 00:04:42.995
She's been practicing
all morning.

00:04:43.081 --> 00:04:44.089
I can see that.

00:04:44.176 --> 00:04:46.016
How very responsible of you.

00:04:46.476 --> 00:04:47.835
Except aren't there supposed
to be two wedding rings?

00:04:49.076 --> 00:04:50.076
Uh-oh.

00:04:51.056 --> 00:04:52.056
Uncle Tommy?

00:04:52.135 --> 00:04:54.875
Hang on.
What's going on here?

00:04:56.956 --> 00:04:58.295
You're gonna do great,
kiddo.

00:04:58.535 --> 00:04:59.535
Bye.

00:04:59.535 --> 00:05:00.795
Hey, baby.
Hi.

00:05:01.694 --> 00:05:03.276
[groomsmen cheering]
[cork pops]

00:05:03.385 --> 00:05:06.047
That's right!
Groom in the building!

00:05:06.155 --> 00:05:07.155
Look at those guys.

00:05:08.275 --> 00:05:09.355
I wish Sonic had that.

00:05:10.175 --> 00:05:12.235
Muscles?Control yourself.

00:05:12.235 --> 00:05:13.235
Mm-hmm.

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:17.179
No. Buddies.
Wingmen. A squad.

00:05:17.295 --> 00:05:20.515
Sonic doesn't have
anything like that.
He's flying solo.

00:05:21.436 --> 00:05:23.456
Baby, you got to relax.

00:05:23.559 --> 00:05:25.651
You're at
the Four Seasons.

00:05:25.755 --> 00:05:28.755
Have a mai tai.
Spend some time
with your wife.

00:05:29.355 --> 00:05:32.115
That's what he said.
Seriously, his exact words.

00:05:32.355 --> 00:05:34.395
See?
He's a smart kid.
All right.

00:05:34.516 --> 00:05:36.573
Hmm.
He'll find his way.

00:05:36.695 --> 00:05:39.515
I absolutely cannot
find my way.
[wind howling]

00:05:39.755 --> 00:05:43.095
We are completely, totally,
unequivocally lost.

00:05:43.202 --> 00:05:44.527
[device beeping]

00:05:44.636 --> 00:05:46.176
Sonic, in this weather,

00:05:46.315 --> 00:05:48.696
there's no way we're gonna get
any readings on this thing!

00:05:49.275 --> 00:05:50.275
Should we go back?

00:05:50.436 --> 00:05:52.255
No, no, no.
There's a light up ahead.

00:05:52.535 --> 00:05:54.075
Maybe we can take shelter
in there.

00:05:58.516 --> 00:06:00.436
Ah. Perfect.

00:06:01.156 --> 00:06:04.076
Are you sure about this?
We don't know who's inside.

00:06:04.476 --> 00:06:07.456
Don't worry.
On Earth, people are
very welcoming,

00:06:07.456 --> 00:06:10.876
and love taking
complete strangers
into their homes.

00:06:10.980 --> 00:06:14.754
[people chattering in Russian]
[up-tempo music playing]

00:06:17.801 --> 00:06:20.398
[door creaks open]

00:06:20.502 --> 00:06:22.961
[music and chatter stops]

00:06:26.527 --> 00:06:28.293
[both gasp]

00:06:29.782 --> 00:06:31.167
[both gasp]

00:06:32.690 --> 00:06:34.179
[both sigh]

00:06:36.707 --> 00:06:37.954
[both scream]

00:06:38.058 --> 00:06:39.581
[grunts]

00:06:41.175 --> 00:06:42.351
Run.

00:06:42.871 --> 00:06:44.671
[groans]

00:06:44.776 --> 00:06:46.515
Table for two, please!

00:06:48.776 --> 00:06:52.544
[in Russian]
What would you like to order?

00:06:52.696 --> 00:06:53.696
Two beef stews, please.

00:06:53.775 --> 00:06:55.391
[translating into Russian]

00:06:57.775 --> 00:06:59.275
Where'd you get
all these cool gadgets?

00:06:59.676 --> 00:07:00.815
I invented 'em.

00:07:01.295 --> 00:07:02.716
That's kinda my thing.

00:07:03.315 --> 00:07:05.875
In fact, my inventions
are how I discovered you.

00:07:06.476 --> 00:07:08.655
Remember that night
at the baseball field?

00:07:09.215 --> 00:07:12.395
Your energy blast
reached all the way
to my home planet.

00:07:12.835 --> 00:07:17.115
I saw you save
your whole village
from that crazy mustache guy.

00:07:17.635 --> 00:07:20.255
Wait, so you've been
watching me this whole time?

00:07:20.775 --> 00:07:21.875
Even in the shower?

00:07:22.476 --> 00:07:24.015
That's a trick question.

00:07:24.495 --> 00:07:26.875
Sonic the Hedgehog
prefers bubble baths.

00:07:26.875 --> 00:07:27.875
Man, you're good!

00:07:28.176 --> 00:07:30.275
When I learned Knuckles
was on your trail,

00:07:30.596 --> 00:07:33.096
I knew I couldn't
just sit back
and watch anymore.

00:07:33.415 --> 00:07:35.176
I had to come warn you.

00:07:35.176 --> 00:07:36.035
[phone chimes]

00:07:36.035 --> 00:07:38.035
Oh, what?
Hang on one sec.

00:07:38.375 --> 00:07:39.375
Donut Lord is checking in.

